@host = http://localhost:5077

### Publikacja w trybie binarnym CloudEvents (ce-* headers + raw payload)
POST {{host}}/cloudevents/publish-binary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipmentId": "SHIP-001",
  "destination": "Warszawa, ul. Marszałkowska 1",
  "carrier": "DHL"
}

###

### Publikacja w trybie structured CloudEvents (koperta application/cloudevents+json)
POST {{host}}/cloudevents/publish-structured
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipmentId": "SHIP-002",
  "destination": "Kraków, ul. Floriańska 5",
  "carrier": "InPost"
}

###

### Publikacja w trybie raw JSON (ADR-001, brak metadanych CloudEvents)
POST {{host}}/barewire/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipmentId": "SHIP-003",
  "destination": "Gdańsk, ul. Długa 10",
  "carrier": "UPS"
}

###

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
